Experimental, off by default: this directory takes part in a build only when
TOLKARA_EXPERIMENTAL_ADAPTERS names GameController (see tools/classify.py).
It was written to get one game past a crash in its controller-connect handler.
It hides every controller from the application that uses it, so in a generic
build it is also opt-in per application (see the "opt-in" marker): only
Cyberpunk 2077's profile asks for it, and World of Warcraft keeps its gamepads. Not yet validated on a device beyond that game.
